{"id":"xbhwh22caf1rz3cfa31rj1s6p","title":"徐卫林院士团队综述：水下超疏气析氢电极的表界面工程与气泡调控进展","originalTitle":null,"summary":"武汉纺织大学陈凤翔教授、姚娜副教授与湖北大学郭志光教授、徐卫林院士综述了水下超疏气电极的设计与应用。文章详细讨论了通过微纳米结构和亲水凝胶调控气泡成核、生长与脱离的机制，以提高析氢反应效率。研究强调了气泡管理对降低过电位、增强传质和提高催化剂稳定性的重要性。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3411509&do=blog&id=1560664"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T05:27:34.148Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T05:27:34.148Z","category":"materials-energy","tags":["论文发表"],"score":39,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}